{"id":6,"title":"Contact Us","slug":"contact-us","url":"/contact-us","language":"en","body":[{"type":"paragraph","value":"<p>News tips, corrections and feedback reach our desk around the clock. For advertising, see <a href=\"/advertise-with-us\">Advertise With Us</a>.</p>","id":"bd3212f8-df2d-4892-87b0-6288c2deec01"},{"type":"heading","value":{"text":"Corrections","level":"h2"},"id":"6384cf6c-6502-4eb3-a878-ae3db535bb0c"},{"type":"paragraph","value":"<p>If we got something wrong, write to us with the link and the correction. We review every request within one working day.</p>","id":"c82dfc07-da29-4404-bc38-14606d1197ea"}],"seo":{"title":"Contact Us","description":"","canonical_url":"__PREVIEW_SITE__/contact-us"},"updated_at":"2026-11-17T15:49:01.586211+05:30","layout":"standard","summary":"","last_updated":"2026-11-17","legal_contact":null}